+-- The genuine insert flow (issue #77): mints the insert approval binding
+-- the proposal core, queues the insert request, folds it into Active with
+-- the representative minted +1 under the applied representative policy,
+-- refuses the occupied-key second insert with its free-key control, and
+-- refuses every new mint/fold check on its reason — all on a real devnet,
+-- with a machine-readable receipt. Source lives in journey/register/.
+executable register-rows
+  import:           warnings
+  default-language: GHC2021
+  hs-source-dirs:   journey/register
+  main-is:          Main.hs
+  build-depends:
+    , aeson
+    , async
+    , base               >=4.14 && <5
+    , base16-bytestring
+    , bytestring
+    , cardano-ledger-api
+    , cardano-ledger-alonzo
